feat(o2): phase 1 MVP

Implements 6 units for the O2 Platform maternal healthcare monitoring system:

Flutter App (U1):
- Brick ORM + SQLCipher offline-first with AES-256 encryption
- Android Keystore-backed key management
- WorkManager sync (WiFi + Charging only)
- FHIR R4 models: Patient, Observation (Vitals), DocumentReference (SBAR)
- Traffic-light risk triage using WHO maternal health thresholds
- ABDM mock with Mod 97 ABHA checksum validation
- Bhashini STT/TTS stubs in constants

Supabase (U2):
- Schema: phc_hierarchy, chw_assignments, patients, vitals_logs, clinical_contact_logs, sbar_documents
- PHC-based RLS isolation via get_user_phc_ids() helper

FastAPI Backend (U3):
- POST /risk — traffic-light triage from vitals input
- POST /sbar — LLM-generated SBAR clinical summary with JSON schema enforcement

IVR Backend (U4):
- Twilio webhook handlers for missed-call to callback to voice recording to WhatsApp
- Patient lookup by caller ID
- Emergency keyword detection (EN/KN/HI)

Documentation:
- docs/solutions/o2-platform-phase1-mvp.md — architectural decisions and file inventory
- STRATEGY.md, docs/plans/, docs/ideation/, docs/brainstorms/ — full product documentation